    <string name="setup_description">Morrow: keyboard with 100% local voice dictation (embedded Whisper).\n\n1. Enable the keyboard in input settings.\n2. Grant the microphone permission.\n3. Use the test button below to validate local STT.\n\nTip: quickly tap SHIFT (arrow) TWICE to turn on CAPS LOCK (all uppercase). The arrow shows an underline when it is on; tap twice again to turn it off.\n\nNo calls are made to Google\'s speech service.</string>
